 "ops": [
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "dia-def",
   "html": "<p><b>Blackbook (Chronic diarrhea):</b> &gt;3 loose stools/day, &gt; 14 days — exclude chronic inflammation. แบ่งเป็น Steatorrhea (oily/foul/hard to flush), Large bowel (small volume/bloody/painful/tenesmus/urgency), Small bowel (large volume/watery)</p>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "dia-cause",
   "html": "<p><b>Blackbook — Chronic diarrhea แยกตามกลุ่ม</b></p><h4>Small Bowel (Large Volume/Watery) — Secretory › Mucosal</h4><ul><li>Crohn’s Disease (Screen with CBC, albumin, ESR, endoscopy)</li><li>Celiac Disease (screen with TTG)</li><li>Chronic Inflammation</li><li>Whipple’s Disease</li></ul><h4>Small Bowel — Secretory › Tumors › Mucosal</h4><ul><li>Gastrinoma</li><li>Carcinoid Syndrome</li><li>Mastocytosis</li></ul><h4>Small Bowel — Secretory › Tumors › Neoplastic</h4><ul><li>Adenocarcinoma</li><li>Lymphoma</li></ul><h4>Small Bowel — Disordered Motility</h4><ul><li>Irritable Bowel Syndrome (diagnosis of exclusion)</li><li>Diabetic Neuropathy</li><li>Hyperthyroidism</li></ul><h4>Small Bowel — Osmotic</h4><ul><li>Magnesium, Phosphate, Sulfate</li><li>Carbohydrate Malabsorption</li><li>Lactose Intolerance</li></ul><h4>Steatorrhea — Maldigestive</h4><ul><li>Pancreatic Insufficiency</li></ul><h4>Steatorrhea — Malabsorptive: Primary Malabsorption</h4><ul><li>Celiac Disease</li><li>Mucosal Disease</li><li>Ileal Crohn’s Disease</li></ul><h4>Steatorrhea — Malabsorptive: Secondary Malabsorption</h4><ul><li>Bacterial Overgrowth</li><li>Liver Cholestasis</li><li>Mesenteric Ischemia</li><li>Short Bowel/ Resection</li></ul><h4>Large Bowel (Small Volume/Bloody/Painful/Tenesmus/Urgency) — Motility</h4><ul><li>Irritable Bowel Syndrome</li><li>Hyperthyroid</li></ul><h4>Large Bowel — Inflammatory</h4><ul><li>Inflammatory Bowel Disease</li><li>Radiation Colitis</li><li>Ischemic Colitis</li></ul><h4>Large Bowel — Secretory</h4><ul><li>Villous Adenoma</li><li>Colon Cancer</li><li>Microscopic Colitis</li></ul>"
  },
